---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Abdul Rehman | Python Developer">
  <div class="about-container">
    <header class="about-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">A brief look into my background</span>
      <h1>About Me</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Python Developer &amp; Systems Enthusiast</p>
    </header>

    <section class="about-content grid grid-2">
      <div class="narrative">
        <h2>My Journey &amp; Philosophy</h2>
        <p>
          Hello, I'm Abdul Rehman. I am a Python developer and systems enthusiast dedicated to building clean, secure, and highly automated applications. My journey into technology is driven by a deep curiosity of software execution flows, combined with a commitment to write script logic that scales and integrates smoothly.
        </p>
        <p>
          My development philosophy is simple: **code should be an elegant solution, not a complex puzzle**. I focus on readability, PEP 8 standards, unit testing, and leveraging scripting to automate administrative tasks across Linux platforms.
        </p>
        <p>
          I approach complex problems with a patient, root-cause analysis mindset. I view technical challenges as opportunities to expand my skill set, shaping a disciplined work ethic centered around continuous learning and technical rigor.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-box mt-lg">
          <p class="cta-text">Interested in how I work?</p>
          <div class="flex gap-md">
            <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}skills-experience`} class="btn btn-primary">
              <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i> Skills & Experience
            </a>
            <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}hire-me`} class="btn btn-outline">
              Get in Touch
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sidebar-cards">
        <div class="card highlight-card">
          <h3>Key Highlights</h3>
          <ul class="highlights-list">
            <li>
              <div class="highlight-icon"><i class="fas fa-check"></i></div>
              <div class="highlight-info">
                <strong>Linux Environments</strong>
                <p>Configuring, administering, and hardening Debian, Ubuntu, and general Linux distributions.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div class="highlight-icon"><i class="fas fa-check"></i></div>
              <div class="highlight-info">
                <strong>Automation First</strong>
                <p>Developing custom Bash and Python workflows to handle backups, monitoring, and provisioning.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div class="highlight-icon"><i class="fas fa-check"></i></div>
              <div class="highlight-info">
                <strong>Continuous Growth</strong>
                <p>Currently specializing in Python scripts automation, software testing, and scientific computing tracks.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card values-card-expanded mt-lg">
          <h3>Core Values</h3>
          <div class="value-item">
            <h4><i class="fa-regular fa-circle-dot"></i> Purpose</h4>
            <p>I aim to implement configurations that solve actual business and user problems, avoiding technological fluff for the sake of it.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-item">
            <h4><i class="fa-regular fa-gem"></i> Integrity</h4>
            <p>Ethical engineering and configuration is paramount. I enforce clean access layers, respect user data privacy, and maintain codebase transparency.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-item">
            <h4><i class="fa-regular fa-star"></i> Excellence</h4>
            <p>Every script I write, library I configure, and deployment I setup is crafted to the highest quality, following standards.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--secondary);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .about-content {
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .about-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
  }

  .narrative p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .cta-box {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background-color: var(--gray-100);
    border-radius: 8px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
  }

  [data-theme="dark"] .cta-box {
    background-color: #222;
  }

  .cta-text {
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .highlight-card {
    background-color: var(--bg-card);
  }

  .highlights-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .highlights-list li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .highlight-icon {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--primary-light);
    color: var(--primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  [data-theme="dark"] .highlight-icon {
    background-color: rgba(1, 172, 106, 0.15);
  }

  .highlight-info strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .highlight-info p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .values-card-expanded {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .value-item h4 {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .value-item h4 i {
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .value-item p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
